WEBVTT

00:00.008 --> 00:35.166
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

01:28.088 --> 01:30.220
[pensive music]

01:30.481 --> 01:33.136
[horse whinnying]
[wind whistling]

01:38.054 --> 01:40.926
[music continues]

01:45.192 --> 01:46.671
- [man] <i>Robert!</i>

01:46.932 --> 01:49.544
[shots firing]

01:54.505 --> 01:55.898
- Thomas!

01:56.159 --> 01:58.205
[firing continues]

01:58.422 --> 01:59.336
Thomas!

02:00.990 --> 02:02.774
It's just Rockefeller.

02:02.992 --> 02:04.602
You doomed us all.

02:04.820 --> 02:06.735
[music continues]

02:06.952 --> 02:08.389
[gun cocks]

02:08.867 --> 02:09.825
[shot firing]

02:12.741 --> 02:16.179
[flames whooshing]

02:16.397 --> 02:17.615
[shot firing]

02:18.660 --> 02:19.617
- Robert!

02:19.835 --> 02:22.272
[flames whooshing]

02:22.533 --> 02:25.014
[pensive music]

02:25.232 --> 02:26.624
Robert!

02:27.669 --> 02:28.583
Robert!

02:33.805 --> 02:34.806
[fist knocking]

02:35.067 --> 02:36.286
- [Officer] <i>Hello!</i>

02:36.547 --> 02:37.592
<i>Who's in there?</i>
[Thomas grimaces]

02:37.853 --> 02:39.071
<i>Open this door!</i>

02:39.333 --> 02:40.595
<i>The police, I am.</i>

02:40.856 --> 02:42.249
<i>Open the door now.</i>

02:43.163 --> 02:45.948
[dramatic music]

03:03.008 --> 03:04.836
[music continues]

03:05.054 --> 03:06.621
[horse nickers]

03:07.970 --> 03:08.840
- Whoa.

03:10.973 --> 03:12.322
Whoa.

03:12.583 --> 03:15.804
[water rippling]

03:30.645 --> 03:31.820
- Howdy.

03:33.038 --> 03:34.431
[chuckles] Whoa.

03:34.692 --> 03:36.694
Kinda jumpy ain't
ya there, Mister?

03:36.955 --> 03:39.828
[water rippling]

03:44.180 --> 03:45.573
- Been awhile since
I seen anyone.

03:47.314 --> 03:48.358
- Oh.

03:56.540 --> 03:58.673
[grunting]

04:00.152 --> 04:03.025
[urine splashing]

04:03.243 --> 04:05.897
[pensive music]

04:06.898 --> 04:08.944
[sighs]

04:15.298 --> 04:19.563
- You know, I heard that Robert
E. Lee is going to rise up

04:19.781 --> 04:20.695
and crush the north.

04:23.872 --> 04:25.265
Make things right again.

04:29.138 --> 04:30.313
♪ Gosh ♪

04:30.574 --> 04:31.923
♪ God saved the south ♪

04:32.184 --> 04:34.317
♪ Yankee bull shut your mouth ♪

04:34.578 --> 04:36.188
♪ God saved the south ♪

04:36.450 --> 04:39.061
♪ Yankee bull shut your mouth ♪

04:39.279 --> 04:40.932
Shut your mouth, Yankee!

04:41.150 --> 04:43.805
[horse snorts]

04:44.022 --> 04:48.679
Northern Cavalry horse,
magnificent creature.

04:48.897 --> 04:51.421
I've not seen one since
the Northern aggression.

04:53.597 --> 04:55.991
You ain't been to New
York lately, have ya?

04:56.252 --> 04:59.124
[music continues]

05:00.822 --> 05:04.042
You see, there's a
fellow from New York

05:04.260 --> 05:06.349
that went and killed
himself a Rockefeller.

05:13.051 --> 05:15.315
It's the largest
reward in history,

05:16.838 --> 05:19.449
and we plan on collecting it.

05:19.667 --> 05:23.453
[chuckles] So,
take your hands off

05:23.671 --> 05:25.542
of that nag and rise them up,

05:27.414 --> 05:29.764
real slow.

05:30.068 --> 05:32.462
[water rippling]

05:36.248 --> 05:40.992
[shots firing]
[horse whinnying]

05:47.390 --> 05:50.045
[bullets whizzing]

06:01.883 --> 06:05.234
[Thomas grunting]
[firing continues]

06:07.018 --> 06:08.368
[guns clicking]

06:12.763 --> 06:15.418
[pensive music]

06:17.333 --> 06:18.508
[shot firing]

06:23.034 --> 06:25.515
[pensive music]

06:32.304 --> 06:34.872
[music continues]

06:38.441 --> 06:41.444
[somber music]

06:50.279 --> 06:53.238
[flies buzzing]
[Thomas grunting]

06:56.503 --> 06:59.288
[water rippling]

07:19.743 --> 07:22.224
[Thomas grunts]

07:22.485 --> 07:25.270
[buzzing continues]

07:35.585 --> 07:40.372
[singer vocalizing]
[soft music]

07:48.859 --> 07:51.296
[eagle calls]

07:53.560 --> 07:57.172
[snake rattling]
[music continues]

08:13.188 --> 08:17.975
[vocalizing continues]
[music continues]

08:33.208 --> 08:37.995
[vocalizing continues]
[music continues]

08:48.266 --> 08:49.920
[music fades]
[wind whistling]

08:51.182 --> 08:51.792
[Thomas spits]

08:53.794 --> 08:57.145
[townspeople chattering]

09:03.934 --> 09:06.589
[pensive music]

09:12.769 --> 09:15.206
[door creaks]

09:19.254 --> 09:21.822
[man munching]

09:28.306 --> 09:29.612
- We've been expectin' you.

09:32.180 --> 09:33.355
[Thomas sighs]

09:34.878 --> 09:35.792
- Sit.

09:37.968 --> 09:40.449
[alcohol splashing]

09:49.023 --> 09:49.893
Our map.

09:50.111 --> 09:52.592
[wind whistling]

10:00.861 --> 10:02.079
[man sighs]

10:05.735 --> 10:09.739
- We want to hear
in your own words,

10:17.094 --> 10:19.531
why we should let you join us.

10:23.144 --> 10:23.753
- Uh...

10:25.450 --> 10:27.627
[upbeat music]

10:42.816 --> 10:44.818
[coins clinking]

10:46.689 --> 10:49.561
[music continues]

11:05.273 --> 11:07.841
[music continues]

11:25.075 --> 11:27.948
[music continues]

11:33.605 --> 11:38.610
- In the name of the Father,
the Son, the Holy Ghost,

11:38.828 --> 11:40.351
your sins are cleansed.

11:40.569 --> 11:41.613
Amen.

11:41.875 --> 11:43.224
- Amen.

11:43.441 --> 11:46.706
[upbeat music]
[singer vocalizing]

11:48.098 --> 11:49.883
[water splashing]

11:57.238 --> 11:59.762
[music softens]
[water splashing]

12:07.117 --> 12:10.947
[bell tolling]
[music continues]

12:13.558 --> 12:15.604
- Loyalty is sacred.

12:15.822 --> 12:16.736
Courage is revered,

12:18.607 --> 12:19.564
and heed this warning.

12:21.001 --> 12:22.219
Betrayal stains the soul.

12:22.480 --> 12:24.091
[shutter clicks]

12:24.308 --> 12:26.963
And its consequence,
a swift demise.

12:29.357 --> 12:34.754
Choose wisely for our
bond is forged in honor,

12:36.712 --> 12:38.235
and sealed in blood.

12:38.453 --> 12:40.934
[wind whistling]

12:43.719 --> 12:44.546
[shutter clicks]

12:44.764 --> 12:47.201
Holy Mother,

12:47.418 --> 12:51.814
the angels and all the
saints come to meet you.

12:52.032 --> 12:54.295
Prepare yourself to be judged

12:54.512 --> 12:57.777
as you go forth from
this life to the next.

12:59.082 --> 13:01.998
[music continues]

13:09.179 --> 13:11.878
[shutter clicks]

13:12.095 --> 13:14.010
[panel thuds]
[rope creaking]

13:19.015 --> 13:21.888
[music continues]

13:24.412 --> 13:26.022
[shutter clicks]

13:29.069 --> 13:31.941
[music continues]

13:42.909 --> 13:44.911
[air whooshing]

13:47.478 --> 13:50.046
- On three, two...

13:51.743 --> 13:57.053
Oh, he looks just like
a little angel at peace,

13:58.228 --> 13:59.969
on his way to heaven.

14:04.669 --> 14:05.540
On three.

14:06.933 --> 14:09.457
And two, one.

14:09.674 --> 14:11.067
Action.

14:11.285 --> 14:13.200
[gentle music]

14:13.461 --> 14:15.071
[horse whinnying]

14:21.121 --> 14:24.341
[music continues]

14:31.131 --> 14:34.003
[music continues]

14:47.756 --> 14:49.366
[horse whinnying]

14:51.064 --> 14:53.588
[music continues]

14:54.676 --> 14:57.113
[music fades]

14:58.767 --> 15:00.725
[horse whinnying]

15:07.080 --> 15:08.603
[pensive music]

15:08.864 --> 15:09.952
[paper crinkling]

15:17.612 --> 15:22.922
[wagon rattling]
[dog barking]

15:23.183 --> 15:26.360
[hooves clomping]
[townspeople chattering]

15:50.819 --> 15:51.733
[upbeat saloon music]

15:51.951 --> 15:53.169
[match strikes]

15:55.693 --> 15:59.436
- Hoodoo, remember what I said
about having a poker face?

15:59.654 --> 16:02.265
- [laughs] Well, I guess not.

16:02.483 --> 16:03.745
- [Hoodoo] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

16:03.963 --> 16:05.181
Your play.

16:05.399 --> 16:07.792
- I'll raise [chuckles].

16:09.403 --> 16:11.535
- Call.

16:11.796 --> 16:14.321
[music continues]
[patrons chattering]

16:18.803 --> 16:21.154
[pensive music]

16:25.419 --> 16:29.249
[upbeat saloon music continues]

16:32.469 --> 16:33.253
- Excuse me?

16:35.516 --> 16:38.954
The stable boy said I
should ask for Jericho.

16:39.172 --> 16:40.260
- Jericho will be back soon.

16:45.439 --> 16:46.744
- I'm looking for a man.

16:46.962 --> 16:49.356
- This is interesting,
this book.

16:50.879 --> 16:52.750
This is Bible.

16:52.968 --> 16:53.708
You should try it.

16:53.969 --> 16:55.492
Read it, it's good.

16:55.710 --> 16:57.059
- I'm looking for Thomas Keller.

17:05.111 --> 17:06.721
- He's not here.

17:06.938 --> 17:12.074
He's six feet under his
mark in the graveyard.

17:12.292 --> 17:14.163
Hung for murder months ago.

17:14.424 --> 17:15.208
- Are you sure?

17:16.296 --> 17:17.993
- I'm not lyin'.

17:18.211 --> 17:19.821
The graveyard's on
the edge of town.

17:20.039 --> 17:21.605
See for yourself.

17:21.866 --> 17:24.347
[both laughing]

17:24.565 --> 17:25.653
- Hi, can I help you?

17:25.870 --> 17:27.046
- Yes.

17:27.263 --> 17:28.786
We need a room for the night.

17:29.004 --> 17:29.657
- And food.

17:31.093 --> 17:32.747
- Yeah.

17:32.964 --> 17:34.836
- Well, we have plenty
of food, but the room?

17:35.054 --> 17:36.403
Afraid we're sold out.

17:36.664 --> 17:37.752
- Is there anywhere
else in town?

17:38.013 --> 17:39.536
- Sorry Ma'am, no.

17:39.797 --> 17:40.668
This it.

17:43.540 --> 17:45.412
- We've been ridin'
all day in the cold.

17:45.629 --> 17:46.500
Please.

17:54.508 --> 17:56.249
- Look, I'm not
supposed to do this,

17:56.466 --> 17:59.295
but you can have
my room, no charge.

18:01.950 --> 18:03.560
- No, I have money.

18:03.778 --> 18:05.519
- Don't, don't,
don't [chuckles].

18:05.736 --> 18:06.650
- Okay.

18:08.826 --> 18:09.523
- Here.

18:09.740 --> 18:10.785
[coins clinking]

18:11.002 --> 18:12.352
- Oh, okay [chuckles].

18:12.613 --> 18:13.657
- Bella?

18:13.918 --> 18:15.094
- Yes?

18:15.311 --> 18:16.791
- Everything all right?

18:17.052 --> 18:18.575
- Yes, Sir.

18:18.793 --> 18:19.446
Just helpin' the lady
out with the room.

18:22.405 --> 18:23.406
- Thank you.

18:23.624 --> 18:25.191
- Upstairs and on the right.

18:25.408 --> 18:27.193
- [Grace] I'm hungry, Mama.

18:27.410 --> 18:28.716
- Here you go.
Tide you over.

18:28.933 --> 18:30.196
- Thank you.

18:30.413 --> 18:31.762
- You are
more than welcome.

18:32.023 --> 18:33.286
- [Valerie] <i>Thank you.</i>
[Ben coughs]

18:35.592 --> 18:37.072
Come on, Grace.

18:37.290 --> 18:38.987
We have a nice bed
to sleep in tonight.

18:39.205 --> 18:40.031
[pensive music]

18:40.293 --> 18:42.686
- [Mary] <i>I'm all in.</i>

18:42.947 --> 18:45.515
- Oh, that too rich
for me [chuckles].

18:47.300 --> 18:50.303
[upbeat saloon music]

18:52.392 --> 18:54.394
- Where do you
reckon they're goin'?

18:54.611 --> 18:56.309
- I don't know.

18:56.526 --> 18:57.919
Polly just got back this
afternoon with that stranger.

18:58.137 --> 18:59.573
I have no clue who he is.

19:04.317 --> 19:05.144
- It's your lucky day.

19:05.361 --> 19:06.362
I'm callin' it quits.

19:07.885 --> 19:10.149
[poker chips clinking]

19:13.064 --> 19:15.545
- All right, why is
everybody so tense?

19:15.763 --> 19:19.027
- Some lady with a child
was askin' 'bout Thomas.

19:19.245 --> 19:21.334
- You didn't say that earlier.

19:21.551 --> 19:24.380
- I was busy readin'
the Bible, Bella.

19:24.598 --> 19:26.165
- I need to tell my dad.

19:26.426 --> 19:28.341
- But tell your daddy I
was readin' the Bible.

19:28.558 --> 19:29.298
- They'll light a
candle for you, Ben.

19:29.559 --> 19:30.952
Hope, watch the bar.

19:31.257 --> 19:32.519
- All right <i>.</i>

19:34.912 --> 19:38.394
- Well, looks like we're
in for a long night.

19:39.352 --> 19:41.789
[door creaks]

19:45.096 --> 19:47.490
- All right, sit
here, eat this bread.

19:47.708 --> 19:49.231
Just don't turn around, okay?

19:58.022 --> 19:58.675
[Valerie exhales]

19:58.936 --> 20:01.591
[pensive music]

20:09.295 --> 20:11.210
[Valerie gasping]

20:19.261 --> 20:21.350
[music continues]

20:22.612 --> 20:24.614
[alcohol sloshing]

20:28.314 --> 20:32.666
[gasping continues]
[music continues]

20:40.500 --> 20:41.370
- Mm.

20:42.545 --> 20:43.459
Mm.

20:47.724 --> 20:51.119
[music continues]
[gasping continues]

20:51.902 --> 20:52.468
Mm.

20:56.690 --> 20:58.431
Mom?
- Yes, baby?

20:58.735 --> 21:00.346
- [Grace] I'm thirsty <i>.</i>

21:00.563 --> 21:03.000
- Just hold on a minute, okay?

21:03.218 --> 21:05.960
[pensive music]

21:10.399 --> 21:15.186
[gasping continues]
[music continues]

21:30.332 --> 21:35.119
[gasping continues]
[music continues]

21:45.478 --> 21:48.350
[anticipatory music]

21:52.354 --> 21:56.358
[gasping continues]

21:56.576 --> 21:58.447
[pensive music]
[skin sizzling]

21:58.708 --> 22:01.494
[gasping continues]

22:02.625 --> 22:03.974
[crows cawing]

22:04.192 --> 22:07.195
[shovels scraping]

22:10.024 --> 22:11.808
- I already told, you
he's not in there.

22:12.026 --> 22:13.593
- I have to be sure.

22:13.810 --> 22:14.811
Move faster.

22:15.029 --> 22:15.986
Come on.

22:16.204 --> 22:17.074
[shovel clinks]

22:17.379 --> 22:18.162
- [Digger] I hit it <i>.</i>

22:22.515 --> 22:24.430
- Open it.

22:24.647 --> 22:25.909
[dirt clattering]
[wind whistling]

22:26.170 --> 22:28.738
[music continues]

22:36.267 --> 22:37.617
[music continues]

22:37.834 --> 22:38.400
Told you.

22:41.272 --> 22:42.622
[gun cocks]

22:43.840 --> 22:46.016
- Shouldn't have done that.

22:46.234 --> 22:48.802
[music continues]

22:52.371 --> 22:53.589
[gun cocks]

22:53.807 --> 22:58.594
[shots firing]
[dramatic music]

22:59.987 --> 23:01.467
[horse whinnying]

23:01.684 --> 23:02.772
- Hyah!

23:11.738 --> 23:12.826
[water splashing]
[horse whinnying]

23:13.783 --> 23:16.656
[music continues]

23:17.657 --> 23:20.529
[water splashing]

23:23.053 --> 23:25.665
[horse whinnying]

23:29.712 --> 23:30.974
Hyah, hyah!

23:31.235 --> 23:32.236
- Come on!

23:34.674 --> 23:37.546
[music continues]

23:52.256 --> 23:55.085
[music continues]

24:05.269 --> 24:07.837
[music continues]

24:17.934 --> 24:20.502
[horse snorts]

24:23.113 --> 24:25.681
[wagon rattling]
[horse whinnying]

24:29.816 --> 24:30.730
- Never gonna be ready for
winter.

24:30.947 --> 24:31.992
- Oh, we'll be all right.

24:32.209 --> 24:34.429
Come on, James.

24:34.647 --> 24:37.824
- You have to visualize
it before you can
see it [chuckles].

24:40.957 --> 24:41.915
- Hey, there's Bella.

24:43.307 --> 24:45.484
[hooves clomping]

24:45.745 --> 24:46.920
She's sure pushin' to get here.

24:52.752 --> 24:53.622
- Thomas?

24:55.232 --> 24:56.930
There's a woman in
town asking for you.

24:57.147 --> 24:58.018
- You get a name?

24:58.235 --> 25:00.324
- No, but she has a kid.

25:00.542 --> 25:01.761
Blonde hair.

25:01.978 --> 25:04.198
Pretty, a northern accent.

25:04.459 --> 25:06.026
- Where is she now?

25:06.243 --> 25:06.853
- My room.

25:08.202 --> 25:09.333
She just paid me a lot.

25:11.945 --> 25:13.642
- Let's go find out
who she is, huh?

25:13.860 --> 25:14.948
- No, no, no, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no, no.

25:15.165 --> 25:16.253
You can't.

25:16.471 --> 25:18.081
Town rules.

25:18.299 --> 25:19.648
You have to hide until
the threat is gone.

25:19.909 --> 25:21.694
- Lin's right, Thomas.

25:21.911 --> 25:23.609
I just spoke to Jericho and
he wants you to stay here.

25:24.348 --> 25:25.828
Come on, Kid.

25:26.046 --> 25:27.526
We'll be back when she's gone.

25:29.615 --> 25:30.790
- Let's get some firewood.

25:34.663 --> 25:37.144
[horse whinnying]
[soft music]

25:44.281 --> 25:46.893
[music continues]

25:49.286 --> 25:51.288
[upbeat saloon music]
[patrons chattering]

25:51.637 --> 25:53.160
[poker chips clinking]

25:59.253 --> 26:01.951
[music continues]

26:09.219 --> 26:10.569
[music continues]

26:10.786 --> 26:11.918
- Probably my favorite.

26:12.179 --> 26:13.441
- [Hope] Mine too.

26:13.659 --> 26:16.226
[Valerie gasping]
[gun cocks]

26:16.444 --> 26:18.838
- I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

26:19.273 --> 26:23.538
- Uh, I think I should go.

26:23.756 --> 26:26.497
- This town is called
Redemption, right?

26:26.715 --> 26:28.587
I'm looking for Thomas Keller.

26:28.804 --> 26:29.718
Do you know him?

26:30.632 --> 26:32.068
- No, Ma'am.

26:32.286 --> 26:34.331
- I hear everyone in
this town is wanted.

26:34.549 --> 26:36.029
Are you one of them?

26:36.246 --> 26:38.640
- I'll be back in a little
bit to draw that bath.

26:38.858 --> 26:40.686
[door opens]

26:42.818 --> 26:44.603
[door closes]

26:44.864 --> 26:46.300
- Hey.
- Oh, shit [laughs]!

26:46.517 --> 26:48.258
How you doin', girl [laughs]?

26:48.476 --> 26:49.825
- [Saloon Worker] What
have you been up to?

26:51.087 --> 26:52.698
Come on, man. Lay off the damn
book

26:52.915 --> 26:54.308
just for tonight,
just for once, Chief.

26:55.222 --> 26:56.745
- Bella tell you
about our new guest?

26:58.486 --> 27:00.053
- No, she did not.

27:00.270 --> 27:02.925
[saloon worker laughs]

27:03.143 --> 27:04.710
- Talk to me.

27:04.927 --> 27:06.973
- Shot in the leg I think.

27:11.064 --> 27:14.284
But Jericho, she
knows all about us.

27:14.502 --> 27:16.199
Keeps asking for Thomas.

27:16.460 --> 27:19.028
[music continues]

27:21.335 --> 27:23.859
[hooves clomping]

27:28.472 --> 27:30.823
[thunder rumbling]

27:32.259 --> 27:34.827
[music continues]

27:38.613 --> 27:41.921
[upbeat saloon music]

27:46.577 --> 27:48.362
[Doc's throat clears]

27:53.236 --> 27:54.107
- There's a posse
headin' into town.

27:55.761 --> 27:57.110
Gonna be here real soon.

27:59.199 --> 27:59.852
- How many men?

28:01.854 --> 28:02.681
- 100 men.

28:04.204 --> 28:04.813
Maybe more.

28:05.988 --> 28:08.904
[music continues]

28:20.524 --> 28:22.265
- What's wrong with you guys?

28:22.526 --> 28:24.920
- Found Thalia and three
men diggin' up a grave.

28:27.662 --> 28:28.532
- Who's grave?

28:31.231 --> 28:31.840
- Thomas Keller.

28:35.757 --> 28:37.585
- Why does Thalia care so
much about Thomas Keller?

28:37.803 --> 28:40.588
- Thomas is the trouble.

28:40.806 --> 28:42.764
Killed a Rockefeller, ain't
gonna just let that go.

28:43.678 --> 28:46.550
[music continues]

28:50.250 --> 28:51.730
[posse yelling faintly]

28:55.908 --> 28:58.649
[wagon rattling]

29:00.695 --> 29:02.349
[music continues]

29:03.393 --> 29:06.222
- Hey, baby, you
stay here, okay?

29:06.440 --> 29:07.528
I gotta go see.

29:09.965 --> 29:11.488
- Hey!

29:11.706 --> 29:13.621
Guys, you gotta come
take a look at this.

29:13.839 --> 29:14.796
There's a posse outside,

29:15.014 --> 29:17.016
and they're coming for me.

29:18.408 --> 29:19.583
- They're not comin' for you.

29:19.801 --> 29:20.933
Enough.

29:30.029 --> 29:32.901
[music continues]

29:39.821 --> 29:42.041
[music continues]

29:50.963 --> 29:51.833
[chair thuds]

30:00.189 --> 30:03.062
[music continues]

30:04.933 --> 30:09.720
[alcohol splashes]
[bottle scrapes]

30:13.420 --> 30:16.075
[alcohol sloshing]

30:20.035 --> 30:22.908
[music continues]

30:32.831 --> 30:34.093
[Robert's throat clears]

30:37.096 --> 30:38.967
- So, where you keepin' my wife?

30:40.708 --> 30:41.883
- Not sure who you mean.

30:43.102 --> 30:45.974
[music continues]

30:47.280 --> 30:47.846
- Well,

30:49.543 --> 30:50.892
my horse is in your stable,

30:53.112 --> 30:54.461
along with my saddle.

30:57.116 --> 31:00.032
I want what's mine.

31:00.249 --> 31:01.860
- You can go ahead
and take what's yours.

31:03.862 --> 31:05.776
Then you can go,

31:05.994 --> 31:08.170
'cause she ain't here.

31:08.388 --> 31:09.868
- So you're gonna
protect a no good whore?

31:11.434 --> 31:12.435
Hm.

31:13.132 --> 31:15.917
[music intensifies]

31:19.399 --> 31:20.661
[bottle scrapes]

31:22.097 --> 31:24.970
[music continues]

31:32.368 --> 31:34.805
[music continues]
[alcohol sloshing]

31:40.420 --> 31:43.249
[throat clears] Well,
that's unfortunate.

31:44.076 --> 31:46.948
[music continues]

31:48.036 --> 31:49.733
[Robert's tongue clicks]
[Robert exhales]

31:52.954 --> 31:54.173
Oh [throat clears],

31:57.002 --> 32:01.658
I am lookin' for a man
named Thomas Keller.

32:01.876 --> 32:04.139
Heard he took up
residence in your town.

32:04.357 --> 32:05.662
- Oh, yeah.

32:05.880 --> 32:08.883
You'll find him
just under his mark,

32:09.101 --> 32:10.363
hung dead months ago [chuckles].

32:13.540 --> 32:14.497
- Josh!

32:14.758 --> 32:17.109
[pensive music]

32:20.590 --> 32:22.375
[coyote head thuds]
[table rattles]

32:24.029 --> 32:25.856
[music continues]

32:26.074 --> 32:27.162
See, that ain't my brother.

32:30.078 --> 32:31.950
So why don't y'all
tell me another story?

32:34.082 --> 32:35.779
And this time make it real good.

32:35.997 --> 32:38.304
[music continues]

32:38.521 --> 32:39.392
Hm.

32:40.697 --> 32:42.003
You must be Jericho.

32:44.484 --> 32:45.093
- That I am.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.230
- I've heard a lot about you.

32:53.449 --> 32:57.062
Rumors of this town.

32:57.279 --> 33:01.370
Well, I didn't think it
was possible [chuckles].

33:01.588 --> 33:05.026
Buncha wanted criminals all
playin' possum [laughs].

33:09.074 --> 33:12.425
My guess is arresting all y'all

33:12.642 --> 33:15.645
would make me a very
rich man [chuckles].

33:15.906 --> 33:18.039
Well, what with the
collectin' and the rewards,

33:18.257 --> 33:22.522
ooh, it's all very tempting.

33:22.739 --> 33:26.004
[music continues]

33:26.221 --> 33:31.009
But I just came for one man.

33:36.927 --> 33:38.016
Thomas Keller.

33:38.233 --> 33:39.626
[knife thuds]

33:41.802 --> 33:44.892
Wanted for the murder of Jess
Rockefeller in New York City.

33:45.110 --> 33:48.069
Reward has been levied
at 100,000 U.S. dollars

33:48.287 --> 33:50.506
and I want him alive.

33:50.724 --> 33:51.855
[door creaking]

33:53.640 --> 33:56.947
- God damn [chuckles], that's
the biggest reward ever.

33:57.165 --> 33:58.340
- Oh, and I've been given orders

33:58.558 --> 34:00.081
to kill any man who
stands in my way.

34:01.474 --> 34:02.692
- Orders from whom?

34:04.520 --> 34:05.739
- Charles
Hughes of New York City.

34:06.000 --> 34:08.481
Governor Charles Hughes.

34:08.698 --> 34:09.221
- Hm.

34:10.874 --> 34:11.832
- This here's Kentucky.

34:13.312 --> 34:18.621
My town, my rules.

34:18.882 --> 34:22.190
- You know there's a wanted
man named Jeremiah McKenzie?

34:24.584 --> 34:27.717
[Robert chuckles]
[music continues]

34:32.461 --> 34:33.071
Yeah.

34:34.550 --> 34:36.770
Yeah, that man fits
your description to a T.

34:38.772 --> 34:40.078
What are the chances
I find a coyote

34:40.339 --> 34:42.123
under his marker
in your graveyard?

34:45.779 --> 34:49.957
Almost everyone in here
is wanted dead or alive,

34:50.175 --> 34:53.439
and the law just
rolled into town.

34:53.700 --> 34:56.877
So you either give me Thomas,

34:57.138 --> 34:59.009
or I'll collect
on all your heads.

35:00.098 --> 35:02.100
- Bitch!
- Fuck you!

35:02.317 --> 35:04.145
[guns cocking]

35:04.363 --> 35:05.233
- Stop!

35:05.494 --> 35:07.366
[knife clinks]

35:07.583 --> 35:09.759
[anticipatory music]

35:13.372 --> 35:14.982
- I told ya,

35:15.200 --> 35:18.812
the man you are looking
for is not here.

35:23.817 --> 35:25.471
I'm gonna give you
one chance to leave

35:28.300 --> 35:30.606
'cause there won't be another.

35:30.824 --> 35:33.392
[music continues]

35:40.007 --> 35:42.923
[music continues]

35:48.233 --> 35:50.931
[Robert laughs]

35:53.803 --> 35:56.284
[doors creaking]

36:04.292 --> 36:05.032
- What are we gonna do now?

36:05.250 --> 36:06.947
- We're gonna get outta here.

36:07.208 --> 36:10.080
- Let's say we give
'em Thomas Keller.

36:10.298 --> 36:11.691
- Yeah, I'll remember that
when they come lookin' for you.

36:11.908 --> 36:15.608
- I don't have a
hundred men chasin' me.

36:15.869 --> 36:17.523
- [chuckles] Only
a fool will believe

36:17.784 --> 36:19.351
that he's only here for Thomas.

36:21.570 --> 36:22.789
Oh, you don't believe me?

36:25.357 --> 36:26.227
Why don't you ask her?

36:35.367 --> 36:36.237
- You and I need to talk.

36:36.933 --> 36:39.588
[pensive music]

36:44.332 --> 36:47.117
- Clear these buildings,
gather up everyone inside.

36:49.076 --> 36:51.078
Must sting to betray
your friends like that.

36:51.296 --> 36:52.819
- Ain't nobody here my friend.

36:54.037 --> 36:55.996
[horse whinnying]

36:56.214 --> 36:59.217
- Hey, gather up some men and
let 'em know we mean business.

36:59.521 --> 37:01.131
- [Posse Member]
You heard him, boys <i>.</i>

37:01.393 --> 37:03.482
[horse whinnying]

37:15.276 --> 37:16.016
- What'd she say?

37:19.193 --> 37:21.239
- It's what she didn't
say that bothered me.

37:22.152 --> 37:23.632
[horse whinnying]

37:25.504 --> 37:27.723
[shots firing]

37:27.941 --> 37:31.510
[objects clattering]
[dramatic music]

37:38.517 --> 37:41.998
- [Grace] Mom, I'm scared <i>.</i>

37:42.216 --> 37:44.174
- You're gonna
hide in here, okay?

37:44.436 --> 37:45.828
- Okay
- Yeah.

37:46.089 --> 37:49.310
[firing continues]
[music continues]

37:56.230 --> 38:00.147
[townspeople groaning]
[firing continues]

38:23.605 --> 38:25.607
[glass shatters]
[Bella gasps]

38:25.825 --> 38:27.392
- Cover the doors
and the windows.

38:27.609 --> 38:29.263
Make sure they do not get in!

38:29.481 --> 38:32.875
[firing continues]
[bullets whizzing]

38:35.574 --> 38:39.099
[pensive music]
[firing continues]

38:45.235 --> 38:46.411
[music continues]
[firing continues]

38:46.628 --> 38:47.803
[Robert yells]

38:48.064 --> 38:49.849
- Stop!

38:50.066 --> 38:51.459
Stop, hold your fire!

38:53.026 --> 38:54.941
Have I made myself clear?

38:57.030 --> 38:57.770
- I've got boxes of
ammo in the back.

38:57.987 --> 38:59.467
- I'll get 'em.

39:01.208 --> 39:03.993
[all yelling]
[fire crackling]

39:05.255 --> 39:09.216
[somber music]
[yelling continues]

39:12.959 --> 39:14.003
[thunder rumbling]

39:17.790 --> 39:21.576
[Lin singing in
foreign language]

39:28.148 --> 39:29.932
[Lin laughs]

39:30.193 --> 39:32.021
- What is that song
you're singin'?

39:32.239 --> 39:34.850
- My grandfather wrote
it and taught it to me.

39:35.068 --> 39:37.418
He used to sing
it to many people.

39:37.636 --> 39:38.898
- You talk a lot about him.

39:39.115 --> 39:41.117
Sounds like a great man.

39:41.335 --> 39:44.643
He scooped me up and brought
me to America when I was 12.

39:44.860 --> 39:46.253
We worked on the rail.

39:46.471 --> 39:47.515
We were part of these teams

39:47.776 --> 39:49.778
that hung in baskets on the side

39:49.996 --> 39:52.955
of the Sierra Nevada Granite
Mountains and set dynamite.

39:55.131 --> 40:00.136
This taskmaster hated him
and cut his fuse short.

40:00.354 --> 40:04.924
My grandfather didn't have a
Chinaman's chance to escape.

40:05.141 --> 40:06.839
So, some years later I
found him playing poker

40:07.056 --> 40:07.622
in the saloon.

40:09.450 --> 40:12.845
11 dead, five wounded.

40:13.062 --> 40:14.412
The sheriff was on
my tail for years.

40:14.629 --> 40:16.239
Wanted dead or alive.

40:18.067 --> 40:18.807
[Lin spits]

40:21.070 --> 40:22.071
Hey,

40:22.898 --> 40:23.464
and you?

40:24.944 --> 40:26.032
Why are you here?

40:26.249 --> 40:27.120
- Ah.

40:29.731 --> 40:31.341
My life ain't worth spit, Lin.

40:32.430 --> 40:35.084
I'm just buyin' time.

40:37.173 --> 40:38.610
[Lin sighs]

40:40.655 --> 40:41.526
[Thomas grunts]

40:41.743 --> 40:43.049
Oh, where you goin'?

40:44.354 --> 40:45.791
- I'm done. I'm done sittin'
here with my

40:46.052 --> 40:46.748
head in the sand.

40:46.966 --> 40:48.968
[Lin laughs]

40:49.185 --> 40:49.795
- Wait for me.

40:51.884 --> 40:55.627
[pensive music]

41:09.075 --> 41:10.903
- I need to find Thomas.

41:11.120 --> 41:12.382
- Lookin' to collect?

41:12.600 --> 41:13.949
- No, please.
Where is he?

41:14.167 --> 41:15.342
- Not here.

41:15.864 --> 41:17.344
But once he hears
all this commotion,

41:18.388 --> 41:20.826
what makes you think
he's gonna come to find?

41:21.043 --> 41:23.089
- Because that man don't know
how to run from anything.

41:27.093 --> 41:28.398
- Okay.

41:28.964 --> 41:32.359
Six boxes of .357 and a
couple dozen shells of buckshot.

41:32.577 --> 41:35.275
- It's not enough.

41:35.536 --> 41:37.930
- Dad, we'll sneak under the
building and into the cave.

41:38.147 --> 41:39.845
No one will see me.

41:40.106 --> 41:42.021
- We go together.

41:42.238 --> 41:44.414
Doc, I'll leave it with ya.

41:45.459 --> 41:47.940
[pensive music]

41:51.465 --> 41:53.859
[horse nickers]

41:55.600 --> 41:57.602
[horse whinnying]

42:02.215 --> 42:03.608
- Friends of yours?

42:03.825 --> 42:04.739
- No.

42:06.219 --> 42:06.785
- Come on.

42:14.575 --> 42:17.360
[thunder rumbling]

42:17.578 --> 42:18.187
- You first.

42:18.492 --> 42:19.798
- Okay <i>.</i>

42:20.015 --> 42:21.060
- I'll be right behind you.

42:21.277 --> 42:22.104
- Okay.
- Go.

42:24.367 --> 42:25.673
- I'm okay <i>.</i>

42:29.372 --> 42:30.852
[hatch thuds]

42:31.070 --> 42:35.248
[anticipatory music]
[horses whinnying]

42:40.209 --> 42:41.776
- [Towns Person] <i>Leave me alone!
Don't touch me!</i>

42:42.037 --> 42:43.125
- Get out from under there <i>.</i>
Come on!

42:43.430 --> 42:44.910
<i>- No, no</i>[screams]!
[shot firing]

42:46.694 --> 42:48.478
[knife whizzing]
[posse member groans]

42:48.696 --> 42:51.177
[posse member groans]

42:51.394 --> 42:53.005
[lantern shatters]

42:53.222 --> 42:55.355
[pensive music]

42:57.009 --> 43:00.099
[hooves clomping]

43:00.403 --> 43:01.796
- Move it <i>.</i>

43:02.014 --> 43:03.232
Come on.

43:04.407 --> 43:05.278
[flames whooshing]

43:05.539 --> 43:07.628
[woman groaning]

43:09.325 --> 43:10.718
- They got Mary.

43:10.936 --> 43:14.809
[Mary grunting]
[firing continues]

43:15.027 --> 43:16.724
I'm gonna go and get Mary.

43:16.985 --> 43:17.638
- Take it.

43:17.856 --> 43:18.639
- No guns.

43:20.075 --> 43:21.163
- Shit.

43:21.381 --> 43:23.905
[dramatic music]

43:24.123 --> 43:26.691
[shots firing]

43:28.997 --> 43:30.956
[glass shattering]
[firing continues]

43:31.217 --> 43:33.480
[music continues]

43:34.655 --> 43:35.700
- Mary, get back inside!

43:35.917 --> 43:36.744
- What the hell are you doing?

43:37.005 --> 43:37.832
- You get back inside!

43:38.050 --> 43:39.007
Mary!

43:39.225 --> 43:40.095
Mary!

43:43.621 --> 43:44.883
Get down.

43:45.100 --> 43:46.058
- Haven't you got a pistol?
- Nah!

43:46.362 --> 43:47.537
- What are you gonna
do, throw rocks?

43:47.799 --> 43:48.887
- I do not have any [indistinct]

43:50.105 --> 43:51.716
- Use your God damn brains.

43:52.107 --> 43:54.719
[bullets whizzing]
[music continues]

43:55.894 --> 43:56.677
- [Jericho] Come on <i>.</i>

43:57.243 --> 44:00.420
[energetic music]
[firing continues]

44:02.814 --> 44:04.119
- I'm gonna go and get Grace.

44:04.337 --> 44:06.339
- I'll go.
Stay here.

44:06.905 --> 44:10.517
[anticipatory music]
[firing continues]

44:16.175 --> 44:18.786
[music continues]

44:22.050 --> 44:26.359
[firing continues]

44:26.576 --> 44:29.797
[townspeople grunting]
[music continues]

44:34.933 --> 44:36.369
- Mary, Ben!

44:36.586 --> 44:40.547
[firing continues]
[music continues]

44:40.765 --> 44:41.722
- Fuck it!

44:41.940 --> 44:44.769
[Ben grunts]

44:44.986 --> 44:46.945
[firing continues]
[music continues]

44:47.162 --> 44:48.511
- Cease fire!
Hold your fire!

44:48.729 --> 44:50.339
Stop, stop!

44:50.992 --> 44:54.343
[firing continues]
[music continues]

44:56.911 --> 44:57.782
Thomas!

44:59.522 --> 45:03.048
[Thomas grunting]

45:03.309 --> 45:05.224
- Thomas, what the hell
are you doin' here?

45:05.441 --> 45:07.487
- Well, I wanted to find out
who's come pay me a visit.

45:07.748 --> 45:09.010
- We're all here
for you, Thomas.

45:09.228 --> 45:13.362
- Next time you try to
save me, grab a pistol.

45:13.580 --> 45:15.277
- There's fire in hell, Mary.

45:16.931 --> 45:17.802
Hot fire.

45:19.412 --> 45:22.545
[wind whistling]
[pensive music]

45:22.763 --> 45:23.633
- Thomas?

45:25.200 --> 45:25.766
- Val?

45:29.117 --> 45:31.990
[music continues]

45:32.207 --> 45:33.295
- Mom.

45:33.513 --> 45:34.993
[Val gasps]

45:39.127 --> 45:40.389
[music continues]

45:40.607 --> 45:41.173
- Thomas!

45:42.827 --> 45:45.960
Thomas!

45:47.440 --> 45:48.571
Thomas!

45:48.789 --> 45:50.095
- Is that Robert?

45:50.356 --> 45:52.924
[music continues]

45:59.191 --> 46:01.759
[music continues]

46:03.630 --> 46:04.936
- Thomas!

46:07.634 --> 46:10.332
[music continues]

46:13.771 --> 46:15.860
[door creaks]

46:16.077 --> 46:20.821
[music continues]
[spurs clinking]

46:26.174 --> 46:27.785
[music continues]

46:28.002 --> 46:28.873
- Robert?

46:32.615 --> 46:33.486
- Jesus.

46:37.098 --> 46:40.798
Are ya surprised to see me?

46:44.105 --> 46:46.151
- I thought you were dead.

46:46.412 --> 46:48.066
- Yeah.

46:48.283 --> 46:51.373
Well, you left me to die.

46:51.634 --> 46:52.200
- No.

46:53.898 --> 46:55.073
I tried to help you.
- Mm hm.

46:56.901 --> 46:57.858
Yeah [smirks].

46:59.381 --> 47:02.036
All my life my big brother
been lookin' out for me

47:04.169 --> 47:06.258
when I did not need your help.

47:09.130 --> 47:11.089
I'm tired of you
tryin' to save me.

47:11.306 --> 47:13.874
[music continues]

47:16.790 --> 47:17.922
Val in there with ya?

47:18.139 --> 47:18.836
- I'm here!

47:19.053 --> 47:20.663
- Oh, how nice!

47:20.881 --> 47:22.404
Your daughter safe?

47:22.622 --> 47:24.189
- You shot me!

47:24.450 --> 47:26.408
- You deserved worse
runnin' off like that!

47:26.669 --> 47:27.714
- That's enough, Robert.

47:29.542 --> 47:31.413
What are you doin'?

47:31.674 --> 47:32.675
- After what she done to you?

47:34.808 --> 47:38.029
She's my wife, Thomas.

47:39.987 --> 47:41.380
I do whatever I
want with my wife.

47:41.597 --> 47:43.338
And don't you put her
in between us either.

47:43.556 --> 47:44.731
We saw where that got us.

47:44.949 --> 47:45.863
- Yeah.

47:48.474 --> 47:51.216
- Probably best if you just
go with me and pay your dues.

47:52.043 --> 47:54.349
'Cause if you don't,
they're gonna hang us all,

47:54.567 --> 47:56.656
and I ain't dyin' for you.

48:00.834 --> 48:04.403
- I ain't goin'
anywhere with you.

48:04.620 --> 48:09.538
You go back to New York
and you tell 'em I'm dead.

48:09.756 --> 48:10.496
- Mm hm.

48:15.327 --> 48:15.936
- That's it <i>.</i>

48:19.984 --> 48:23.030
[music continues]
[spurs clinking]

48:29.080 --> 48:31.778
[music continues]

48:31.996 --> 48:33.693
[doors creaking]

48:36.914 --> 48:39.786
[Robert chuckles]

48:44.747 --> 48:48.186
[Valerie gasps]
[pensive music]

48:54.627 --> 48:58.674
- You all got 15
minutes to decide

48:58.892 --> 49:01.939
where your loyalties lie!

49:02.200 --> 49:04.985
Those who wish to
depart the saloon,

49:05.203 --> 49:06.944
I'll grant ya safe passage.

49:08.380 --> 49:10.208
Those who remain behind,

49:13.646 --> 49:14.995
God help ya!

49:15.213 --> 49:18.216
[music continues]

49:26.180 --> 49:29.183
- Listen, I don't anticipate

49:29.401 --> 49:31.011
any of you stayin'
on my account.

49:32.186 --> 49:34.232
[thunder rumbling]

49:34.449 --> 49:37.452
None of you owe me a damn thing.

49:37.670 --> 49:39.367
There's no reason for
you to die here tonight.

49:41.935 --> 49:43.676
- Oh, I got a reason.

49:46.940 --> 49:48.681
I got one right here.

49:54.687 --> 49:55.688
Couple more over there.

49:57.690 --> 50:00.432
[thunder rumbling]
[gentle music]

50:00.693 --> 50:03.261
And Ben's Jesus-y ass and
all three of his marbles.

50:05.959 --> 50:07.134
Even you, Thomas.

50:12.183 --> 50:14.228
Look, they know who we are
and they know what we've done,

50:14.446 --> 50:17.579
so they're comin' for all of us.

50:18.624 --> 50:21.105
The only way we get outta
here is if we do it together.

50:23.237 --> 50:24.804
So, if I got me death tonight,

50:29.504 --> 50:30.070
fuck it.

50:33.421 --> 50:34.683
Long overdue.

50:34.901 --> 50:38.687
[Lin speaking in
foreign language]

50:38.905 --> 50:39.819
- Hell yeah.

50:40.994 --> 50:43.518
[gentle music]

50:46.869 --> 50:48.175
[Thomas exhales]

50:50.264 --> 50:51.744
- All right, then.

50:52.005 --> 50:54.877
[music continues]

50:57.576 --> 51:02.407
[fire crackling]
[water dripping]

51:13.896 --> 51:14.767
Hey.

51:16.508 --> 51:17.204
What's your name?

51:17.465 --> 51:18.597
- Gracie.

51:18.814 --> 51:20.033
- Gracie Ann Keller.

51:20.251 --> 51:21.513
- Yes, Sir, Gracie Ann Keller.

51:21.730 --> 51:23.167
That's my name.

51:23.384 --> 51:25.125
- My mother's name was Ann.

51:25.343 --> 51:26.474
- I know, it was my idea.

51:28.607 --> 51:29.956
- Well, it's nice
to meet you Gracie.

51:30.174 --> 51:31.653
- Nice to meet you.

51:31.914 --> 51:33.568
[Thomas chuckles]
[Valerie chuckles]

51:33.829 --> 51:36.354
[gentle music]

51:39.618 --> 51:41.315
- What happened to him?

51:41.794 --> 51:44.275
- It took him a year to
recover from the burns,

51:44.492 --> 51:45.885
and the Rockefellers are
hell bent on revenge.

51:46.146 --> 51:46.755
They searched New York for you.

51:46.973 --> 51:48.844
They spread west.

51:49.062 --> 51:51.891
He got a deal that he'd find
you and bring you in alive.

51:52.109 --> 51:53.153
He's obsessed with you.

51:53.371 --> 51:55.242
He blames you for everything.

51:55.460 --> 51:57.679
- And you rode all the way
from New York to warn me?

51:57.940 --> 51:59.986
- Oh, I rode with
Robert most of the way,

52:00.204 --> 52:03.076
but then I stole his
horse when we got closer.

52:03.337 --> 52:05.600
- [Robert] <i>Clock's tickin'!</i>

52:05.861 --> 52:07.646
<i>Make the right decision.</i>

52:07.907 --> 52:08.777
<i>And quick!</i>

52:10.997 --> 52:12.303
- I need a damn pistol.

52:14.000 --> 52:15.349
- [Levi] That should
treat you right <i>.</i>

52:16.611 --> 52:18.265
- Thomas, don't trust him.

52:20.093 --> 52:22.748
[pensive music]

52:26.578 --> 52:30.059
[fire crackling]
[water dripping]

52:32.236 --> 52:33.715
- Let's load up.

52:33.976 --> 52:38.155
[energetic music]
[singer vocalizing]

52:43.421 --> 52:48.165
[vocalizing continues]
[music continues]

52:55.172 --> 52:57.609
- Time's up!

52:57.870 --> 53:01.917
If you don't leave now,
you ain't never leavin'!

53:02.135 --> 53:04.616
- Those of you who are
patrons for the night,

53:04.833 --> 53:05.747
gather your things and go.

53:05.965 --> 53:08.750
[wind whistling]

53:17.585 --> 53:20.327
[doors creaking]

53:25.593 --> 53:28.466
- Hope, you take
good care of him.

53:28.683 --> 53:30.729
- I will.

53:30.946 --> 53:35.342
[floorboards creaking]
[wind whistling]

53:36.822 --> 53:39.477
[pensive music]

53:45.178 --> 53:47.136
[music continues]

53:48.399 --> 53:49.791
[gun cocks]

53:50.052 --> 53:54.361
[shots firing]
[townspeople groaning]

53:56.276 --> 54:01.063
[music continues]
[firing continues]

54:06.330 --> 54:11.117
[music continues]
[firing continues]

54:16.383 --> 54:21.170
[music continues]
[firing continues]

54:22.433 --> 54:23.956
[chamber spinning]

54:24.173 --> 54:29.570
[firing continues]
[townspeople grunting]

54:29.788 --> 54:30.745
- Hope, let's go!

54:30.963 --> 54:32.399
Follow me!

54:32.617 --> 54:38.275
[firing continues]
[bullets whizzing]

54:38.536 --> 54:41.930
[somber music]
[whizzing continues]

54:47.327 --> 54:51.375
[music continues]
[sound muffles]

54:55.683 --> 54:57.294
[indistinct]

54:57.555 --> 55:01.428
[firing continues faintly]

55:01.689 --> 55:03.169
[air whooshing]

55:03.387 --> 55:07.347
[firing continues]
[anticipatory music]

55:12.396 --> 55:17.183
[music continues]
[bullets whizzing]

55:19.577 --> 55:22.971
[firing continues]
[townspeople groaning]

55:23.189 --> 55:24.146
[gun clicking]

55:24.364 --> 55:26.758
- I'm out!

55:26.975 --> 55:29.761
Christ, if you ain't
gonna shoot, then reload.

55:29.978 --> 55:33.808
[firing continues]
[music continues]

55:37.595 --> 55:39.205
- What are you doin'?
- Let's go.

55:39.423 --> 55:40.467
I need to get Grace outta here.

55:40.685 --> 55:41.163
We can go out the back window.

55:41.381 --> 55:42.339
It's dark.

55:42.556 --> 55:43.340
They won't see us.

55:49.389 --> 55:50.825
- Come on [groans]!

55:51.043 --> 55:53.262
[firing continues]
[music continues]

55:53.524 --> 55:55.613
- Thomas, please!

55:55.830 --> 55:56.788
- I can't.

55:57.005 --> 55:59.443
I'm sorry.

55:59.660 --> 56:03.142
[firing continues]
[music continues]

56:03.403 --> 56:05.362
[posse members groaning]

56:09.191 --> 56:10.671
- Cover up!

56:10.889 --> 56:14.196
[firing continues]
[glass shatters]

56:16.416 --> 56:17.678
- Levi, back room!

56:17.896 --> 56:22.509
[firing continues]
[pensive music]

56:25.469 --> 56:31.910
[townspeople groaning]
[music continues]

56:32.127 --> 56:36.523
[firing continues]
[townspeople groaning]

56:38.307 --> 56:43.748
[music continues]
[firing continues]

56:44.009 --> 56:45.271
[Hoodoo groans]

56:45.489 --> 56:49.667
[music continues]
[both grunting]

56:55.803 --> 56:59.851
[music continues]
[firing continues]

57:00.286 --> 57:03.202
[towns person screaming]

57:03.942 --> 57:05.378
[Mary screams]
[glass shatters]

57:05.596 --> 57:08.555
[firing continues]
[bullets whizzing]

57:12.951 --> 57:15.823
[rain pattering]
[music continues]

57:22.177 --> 57:23.918
[music continues]

57:24.136 --> 57:26.747
- Anyone left alive
in that saloon

57:26.965 --> 57:29.663
better shove Thomas
out the front door!

57:29.881 --> 57:34.581
[rain pattering]
[thunder rumbling]

57:34.842 --> 57:37.366
[Levi panting]

57:39.543 --> 57:42.023
[Levi groans]

57:50.641 --> 57:52.164
- You know, I could
live to be 100

57:52.381 --> 57:53.731
and not understand your
loyalty to this God of yours.

57:55.733 --> 57:58.344
Hell, got us all into this mess.

57:58.562 --> 57:59.780
You know, you're
a good man, Ben,

57:59.998 --> 58:03.131
and there ain't no shame
in keepin' your promise.

58:03.349 --> 58:04.437
I can respect that,

58:04.655 --> 58:10.051
but don't ask me
to understand it

58:10.269 --> 58:11.966
'cause it don't make no
God damn sense to me.

58:12.227 --> 58:15.840
[rain pattering]

58:16.101 --> 58:18.756
[thunder rumbling]

58:24.370 --> 58:26.111
[Thomas gasps]

58:28.896 --> 58:30.768
- Val [grunts].

58:30.985 --> 58:32.117
You all right?
[hand slaps]

58:32.334 --> 58:33.901
[groans] Hey!

58:34.206 --> 58:35.033
- [Valerie] You should've
come back for me <i>.</i>

58:35.250 --> 58:36.425
I was waiting for you <i>.</i>

58:36.687 --> 58:38.515
- It was too dangerous, Val.

58:38.732 --> 58:40.212
They would've killed you.

58:40.429 --> 58:40.995
- Gracie, come on.

58:41.256 --> 58:42.736
Come here.

58:42.954 --> 58:44.477
I don't think so.

58:44.695 --> 58:49.526
[thunder rumbling]
[rain pattering]

58:55.488 --> 58:56.271
[pensive music]

58:56.489 --> 58:57.229
- Come on, bastard.

58:57.446 --> 58:58.447
Nice, come on.

58:59.318 --> 59:00.188
- Doc?

59:03.931 --> 59:05.193
I think I'm gonna
need your services.

59:05.411 --> 59:06.064
- Help me!

59:06.281 --> 59:07.456
[Hoodoo groans]

59:07.674 --> 59:08.893
[glass shatters]
[music continues]

59:09.154 --> 59:11.722
- Kid, in my room I
have a surgical kit.

59:13.462 --> 59:18.206
[Hoodoo groaning]

59:18.424 --> 59:19.207
- Oh, it hurts!

59:21.383 --> 59:22.210
I apologize.

59:22.428 --> 59:23.560
- Hey, shut up, Hoodoo.

59:23.777 --> 59:25.213
Ya ain't dyin'.

59:25.431 --> 59:27.694
[Hoodoo groaning]
[music continues]

59:27.955 --> 59:31.785
[Hoodoo coughs]

59:32.003 --> 59:34.222
- All right, Kid.
Give it here.

59:34.440 --> 59:35.528
Give him some whiskey.

59:35.746 --> 59:36.703
- Okay.
- [groans] It hurts!

59:36.964 --> 59:38.531
It hurts.
- Okay, okay, hey, hey!

59:38.749 --> 59:39.924
Not that one, that one's
gonna make him blind.

59:40.185 --> 59:40.881
- Mary.
- Hey!

59:41.099 --> 59:43.405
[Hoodoo groaning]

59:43.623 --> 59:44.581
- Cool.

59:44.798 --> 59:46.495
Here, come on.

59:46.757 --> 59:48.323
Drink.

59:48.541 --> 59:49.586
- All right, that's
enough, that's enough.

59:49.847 --> 59:50.848
- Hand it.
- Bandage here.

59:51.065 --> 59:53.851
[Hoodoo screams]

59:54.634 --> 59:55.896
- It hurts!

59:56.636 --> 59:57.855
- Don't mind if I do.

59:58.072 --> 59:59.291
- Hey, hold him down.
- Hurts!

59:59.508 --> 01:00:00.684
Okay, Doc, Doc, no, no, no.

01:00:00.901 --> 01:00:01.728
Listen to me.

01:00:01.989 --> 01:00:04.035
Please, listen to me.

01:00:04.252 --> 01:00:05.602
I'll let you win
every time we play.

01:00:05.863 --> 01:00:07.038
- You'd be dead before
I could collect.

01:00:07.255 --> 01:00:08.648
- Please!

01:00:08.866 --> 01:00:10.302
[Hoodoo screaming]

01:00:10.519 --> 01:00:11.390
Listen to me, let go!

01:00:11.608 --> 01:00:12.391
- [Doc] Wait, wait, wait!

01:00:12.609 --> 01:00:13.958
- You ain't cuttin' me!

01:00:14.219 --> 01:00:15.307
- Stop movin' around.
- Doc!

01:00:15.524 --> 01:00:17.004
- You ain't cuttin' me.
- Okay.

01:00:17.222 --> 01:00:18.049
- [Hoodoo] Doc, you
ain't cuttin' me!

01:00:18.266 --> 01:00:19.833
- Stop movin' around.

01:00:20.094 --> 01:00:21.661
- [Hoodoo] You have
your hands inside me!

01:00:21.879 --> 01:00:23.184
- I feel it!

01:00:23.445 --> 01:00:24.708
- [Levi] Come on, Doc.

01:00:24.925 --> 01:00:27.493
- [Mary] Almost there.
[Hoodoo screams]

01:00:28.450 --> 01:00:30.061
- I got it.

01:00:30.278 --> 01:00:31.758
[thunder rumbling]
[rain pattering]

01:00:32.019 --> 01:00:34.152
[Hoodoo gasping]

01:00:34.369 --> 01:00:37.155
- It's shiny, it's shiny.

01:00:37.372 --> 01:00:39.505
- Rest up, sunshine,
you're gonna be all right.

01:00:39.723 --> 01:00:42.551
- You did good, you did good.

01:00:43.465 --> 01:00:44.466
Good, good.

01:00:48.732 --> 01:00:50.559
- Son of a bitch.

01:00:50.777 --> 01:00:54.346
[rain pattering]
[thunder rumbling]

01:00:57.175 --> 01:00:59.525
- Where's your big dad?

01:00:59.743 --> 01:01:00.918
- Kid.
- Sorry, Sir.

01:01:02.528 --> 01:01:03.224
- I'm fine.

01:01:08.490 --> 01:01:10.928
- Everyone, get your weapons.

01:01:11.145 --> 01:01:13.104
- Damn happy to see you.

01:01:13.321 --> 01:01:14.322
- Feeling's mutual.

01:01:14.540 --> 01:01:15.889
- About damn time you showed up.

01:01:16.150 --> 01:01:18.544
- Mary, didn't expect
to see you here.

01:01:18.762 --> 01:01:21.112
- Well, they broke in my
store and tried to kill me.

01:01:21.329 --> 01:01:22.504
- You had some help.

01:01:23.984 --> 01:01:26.117
- This is all the help I need.

01:01:26.334 --> 01:01:28.119
Ben, put these on.

01:01:28.380 --> 01:01:30.164
No time to fret over
some stupid promise.

01:01:30.382 --> 01:01:33.907
[gentle music]
[thunder rumbling]

01:01:39.086 --> 01:01:41.219
[belt clinking]
[music continues]

01:01:41.436 --> 01:01:44.918
- I thought you threw
these away, Jericho.

01:01:45.136 --> 01:01:47.051
- Would I do that to you?

01:01:48.008 --> 01:01:51.925
[music continues]
[thunder rumbling]

01:01:54.754 --> 01:01:56.843
- Hey, the ladies.

01:01:58.758 --> 01:02:02.283
[energetic music]

01:02:10.378 --> 01:02:11.423
[cork pops]

01:02:16.036 --> 01:02:18.996
[music continues]
[thunder rumbling]

01:02:20.127 --> 01:02:22.869
[belt clinking]

01:02:26.133 --> 01:02:29.049
[music continues]

01:02:29.615 --> 01:02:31.965
[singer vocalizing]

01:02:36.143 --> 01:02:39.190
[music continues]

01:02:41.366 --> 01:02:43.194
- Thomas!

01:02:46.980 --> 01:02:47.851
Thomas!

01:02:49.026 --> 01:02:50.592
Thomas!

01:02:52.594 --> 01:02:55.032
I call a truce!

01:02:55.249 --> 01:02:57.425
[rain pattering]
[thunder rumbling]

01:02:58.513 --> 01:02:59.514
- I'm listenin'.

01:02:59.732 --> 01:03:02.648
- Come to New York with me.

01:03:02.866 --> 01:03:03.954
You'll have your day in court.

01:03:05.694 --> 01:03:07.261
They'll condemn
you to the gallows.

01:03:08.262 --> 01:03:09.916
Before you hang, I'll have
someone take

01:03:10.177 --> 01:03:12.223
your place under the hood.

01:03:14.268 --> 01:03:17.576
While they watch him
hang, you'll escape.

01:03:17.837 --> 01:03:19.273
I'll make sure they never know.

01:03:20.361 --> 01:03:23.234
You told them they all
could leave peacefully.

01:03:23.495 --> 01:03:25.410
Why would I believe
anything you have to say?

01:03:26.498 --> 01:03:28.630
[guns cocking]

01:03:28.848 --> 01:03:30.894
Wait!

01:03:31.111 --> 01:03:34.593
[rain pattering]
[thunder rumbling]

01:03:35.246 --> 01:03:37.814
[music continues]

01:03:45.778 --> 01:03:46.300
What, Robert?

01:03:50.087 --> 01:03:51.958
- I won't let 'em kill ya.

01:03:54.221 --> 01:03:55.353
You're my brother.

01:03:55.570 --> 01:03:58.269
[thunder rumbling]

01:04:00.097 --> 01:04:01.228
Hell, I can't kill ya.

01:04:03.491 --> 01:04:05.493
We made a promise to
never hurt each other.

01:04:10.890 --> 01:04:13.980
But I can't go back to
New York without ya.

01:04:14.241 --> 01:04:17.027
[music continues]

01:04:17.244 --> 01:04:19.856
I'm fightin' for
all of us, Thomas.

01:04:21.466 --> 01:04:22.336
For you,

01:04:26.601 --> 01:04:27.298
for our family,

01:04:30.040 --> 01:04:31.258
for Val and Grace.

01:04:34.696 --> 01:04:36.263
And when this is
all done, we can...

01:04:37.699 --> 01:04:38.483
We can start again.

01:04:41.181 --> 01:04:44.532
Very rich men far from New York.

01:04:45.185 --> 01:04:48.710
[thunder rumbling]
[soft music]

01:04:50.103 --> 01:04:51.452
[gun cocks]
- Thomas!

01:04:53.280 --> 01:04:56.936
[shots firing]
[pensive music]

01:04:58.895 --> 01:05:01.898
[thunder rumbling]

01:05:03.203 --> 01:05:04.901
[Thomas grunts]

01:05:11.820 --> 01:05:13.344
[music continues]

01:05:14.388 --> 01:05:16.347
[Lin speaking in
foreign language]

01:05:16.695 --> 01:05:18.262
[James chuckles]

01:05:18.523 --> 01:05:19.611
- Hm?

01:05:20.133 --> 01:05:23.180
- Hey, try this.

01:05:24.224 --> 01:05:25.008
- Thank you.

01:05:25.225 --> 01:05:26.357
- Good for the soul.

01:05:26.574 --> 01:05:27.488
- Okay.

01:05:29.186 --> 01:05:31.971
[rain pattering]

01:05:34.756 --> 01:05:37.759
[thunder rumbling]

01:05:40.545 --> 01:05:42.373
- You never told me
you're from New York.

01:05:44.636 --> 01:05:45.767
- Yeah.

01:05:46.681 --> 01:05:48.770
[thunder rumbling]

01:05:49.597 --> 01:05:52.949
- What part?
- Five Points.

01:05:53.210 --> 01:05:54.733
- What's the Five Points?

01:05:54.994 --> 01:05:56.865
- [Valerie] This is
your bedtime, baby.

01:06:01.348 --> 01:06:03.524
- Oh, it's in slums, James.

01:06:05.831 --> 01:06:07.093
- I've never been to a big city.

01:06:09.139 --> 01:06:10.531
Had a partner from
New York once.

01:06:12.055 --> 01:06:13.621
He said it was a city of dreams,

01:06:15.145 --> 01:06:16.450
opportunity on every corner.

01:06:18.235 --> 01:06:19.018
Fortune's abound.

01:06:24.067 --> 01:06:25.372
- I thought the same thing once.

01:06:27.287 --> 01:06:28.636
I tried to make a difference,

01:06:28.854 --> 01:06:33.554
but the rich kill
without regard.

01:06:35.687 --> 01:06:37.428
No, Sir.

01:06:37.689 --> 01:06:39.952
There ain't no dreams comin'
true for me in New York.

01:06:40.170 --> 01:06:40.997
- "It's easier for a camel-"

01:06:41.214 --> 01:06:42.215
- Camel!

01:06:42.433 --> 01:06:43.303
- "To go through
a needle's eye-"

01:06:43.521 --> 01:06:44.348
- Needle!

01:06:44.609 --> 01:06:45.871
- "Than for a rich man

01:06:46.089 --> 01:06:47.481
to enter into the
Kingdom of God."

01:06:47.699 --> 01:06:49.005
- You got that right, Doc.

01:06:49.222 --> 01:06:50.832
Sweet Jesus, mm hm.

01:06:51.050 --> 01:06:53.313
Praise the Lord.
How!

01:06:53.531 --> 01:06:56.229
[pensive music]

01:07:02.540 --> 01:07:06.500
- That woman, she
risked her life

01:07:06.718 --> 01:07:08.459
and her daughter's life
to come and see you.

01:07:08.676 --> 01:07:11.114
[thunder rumbling]

01:07:11.331 --> 01:07:12.637
She's got somethin' to say.

01:07:15.074 --> 01:07:16.032
She ain't sayin' it.

01:07:18.077 --> 01:07:19.078
Not in front of us.

01:07:23.865 --> 01:07:26.520
[thunder rumbling]

01:07:28.566 --> 01:07:31.047
[Lin vocalizing]

01:07:35.051 --> 01:07:37.053
- I like it, I like it.

01:07:37.314 --> 01:07:41.100
[Lin singing in
foreign language]

01:07:45.148 --> 01:07:47.541
[anticipatory music]

01:07:47.759 --> 01:07:50.936
[thunder rumbling]
[rain pattering]

01:07:57.290 --> 01:08:00.598
- Surprised they let you out.

01:08:00.815 --> 01:08:05.211
- There's a [chuckles]
trap door in the back room.

01:08:05.429 --> 01:08:08.258
[thunder rumbling]
[rain pattering]

01:08:12.175 --> 01:08:14.438
- You're puttin' up
a hell of a fight.

01:08:18.268 --> 01:08:19.921
Guess the rumor's
are true [chuckles].

01:08:24.491 --> 01:08:26.972
Best of the best.

01:08:27.190 --> 01:08:30.149
[thunder rumbling]
[rain pattering]

01:08:32.195 --> 01:08:33.979
Ain't that many
gunslingers left.

01:08:36.373 --> 01:08:38.375
- They ain't givin' up neither.

01:08:38.592 --> 01:08:40.246
[thunder rumbling]

01:08:40.507 --> 01:08:41.378
- Yeah?

01:08:44.032 --> 01:08:45.556
Mr. Brother's always
been hard-headed.

01:08:45.773 --> 01:08:48.036
- Why don't you let me
bring him to ya alive?

01:08:49.647 --> 01:08:51.649
[pensive music]

01:08:51.866 --> 01:08:53.259
[Kelly chuckles]

01:08:57.394 --> 01:08:58.395
[gun cocks]

01:09:01.354 --> 01:09:04.531
- You're a roach
compared to him.

01:09:09.014 --> 01:09:13.497
Bring him to me,
then we have a deal.

01:09:14.585 --> 01:09:18.632
[thunder rumbling]
[music continues]

01:09:24.856 --> 01:09:27.685
- "On the streets where the
blades of grass don't grow,

01:09:27.902 --> 01:09:30.296
everything is like everything.

01:09:30.514 --> 01:09:31.993
That's why children
who grow up in cities

01:09:32.211 --> 01:09:34.518
are so incredibly naughty.

01:09:36.084 --> 01:09:38.261
But love keeps up warm and safe,

01:09:38.478 --> 01:09:40.785
even on the darkest of nights.

01:09:42.308 --> 01:09:45.398
[gentle music]
[thunder rumbling]

01:09:49.968 --> 01:09:52.405
And really good little
children get special treats."

01:09:53.667 --> 01:09:56.235
[Valerie panting]

01:10:03.242 --> 01:10:04.896
- You should let me
take a look at that.

01:10:05.157 --> 01:10:07.681
[gentle music]

01:10:13.818 --> 01:10:16.647
That book you were reading
of hers, it's good.

01:10:20.390 --> 01:10:22.218
"Love makes you
feel warm and safe,

01:10:23.915 --> 01:10:25.482
even on the darkest of nights."

01:10:27.658 --> 01:10:29.007
- Shh, come here.

01:10:33.141 --> 01:10:35.318
[door creaking]

01:10:39.278 --> 01:10:39.887
What do you want?

01:10:42.455 --> 01:10:43.326
- To talk.

01:10:44.414 --> 01:10:45.545
- Hm.

01:10:45.763 --> 01:10:47.112
What do you wanna talk about?

01:10:50.071 --> 01:10:51.290
- I wanted to come back for you.

01:10:53.727 --> 01:10:54.859
I thought about it every day.

01:10:55.076 --> 01:10:57.078
[thunder rumbling]

01:10:57.862 --> 01:10:59.690
But if I did, I knew
they would hurt you.

01:11:02.823 --> 01:11:05.130
And I knew you'd find
a way to survive.

01:11:05.348 --> 01:11:06.827
- It's not about that.

01:11:07.088 --> 01:11:08.960
I don't care about the risk.

01:11:09.177 --> 01:11:10.309
I need to be with you.

01:11:11.658 --> 01:11:13.530
I've been waiting for
you all these years.

01:11:14.966 --> 01:11:16.141
I love you.

01:11:17.664 --> 01:11:21.364
[thunder rumbling]
[gentle music]

01:11:26.151 --> 01:11:28.501
[pensive music]

01:11:35.029 --> 01:11:36.857
[music fades]

01:11:38.032 --> 01:11:40.557
[crows cawing]

01:11:42.820 --> 01:11:45.562
[spurs clinking]

01:11:56.224 --> 01:11:56.790
- Coffee?

01:11:58.836 --> 01:12:00.098
- Great, thanks.

01:12:10.630 --> 01:12:13.503
[objects clattering]

01:12:16.244 --> 01:12:18.769
[pensive music]

01:12:19.378 --> 01:12:21.206
- Wake up, baby.

01:12:21.424 --> 01:12:22.338
We're leavin'.

01:12:23.513 --> 01:12:24.557
Don't wake her up.

01:12:26.994 --> 01:12:29.867
Here, your boots.

01:12:30.084 --> 01:12:34.350
[wind whistling]
[anticipatory music]

01:12:39.267 --> 01:12:41.835
[music continues]

01:12:51.889 --> 01:12:52.498
- Hey, you.

01:12:55.022 --> 01:12:55.632
- No one move!

01:13:01.289 --> 01:13:02.508
- [Doc] Kelly,
what are you doin'?

01:13:02.856 --> 01:13:03.814
- Surviving!

01:13:04.031 --> 01:13:05.250
- He said he'd leave us alone

01:13:05.468 --> 01:13:07.034
if I bring him Thomas.

01:13:07.252 --> 01:13:11.125
I'm doin' what none of
y'all have the guts to do!

01:13:11.343 --> 01:13:13.389
Outside, both of ya now.

01:13:13.606 --> 01:13:15.086
- No one move!
- I'll kill him.

01:13:15.347 --> 01:13:16.653
I'll do it, God damn it!

01:13:16.870 --> 01:13:19.046
- Then you're all dead.
- Hold it!

01:13:19.264 --> 01:13:20.178
Hold it.

01:13:23.050 --> 01:13:24.269
I'll go out.

01:13:24.487 --> 01:13:25.401
I'll go.

01:13:26.793 --> 01:13:27.751
- We're goin' with you.

01:13:29.274 --> 01:13:31.319
- Let's go.
Stay behind.

01:13:31.668 --> 01:13:35.454
[wagon rattling]
[pensive music]

01:13:41.329 --> 01:13:43.897
[music continues]

01:13:46.465 --> 01:13:48.162
- Hey.
- Baptize me.

01:13:48.380 --> 01:13:51.296
Matthew 3:14.

01:13:53.298 --> 01:13:55.866
[music continues]

01:14:09.096 --> 01:14:10.446
- Hello, brother.

01:14:12.970 --> 01:14:14.014
- Let's go home, Robert.

01:14:15.015 --> 01:14:15.886
- Yeah.

01:14:17.061 --> 01:14:18.279
Let's.

01:14:18.497 --> 01:14:20.456
[Thomas groans]

01:14:22.936 --> 01:14:24.460
We ain't leavin' yet.

01:14:24.677 --> 01:14:28.115
A lotta good men died here.

01:14:28.333 --> 01:14:31.162
- It's me you want, not
these people damn it.

01:14:31.423 --> 01:14:33.164
What are you doin'?

01:14:33.381 --> 01:14:34.252
[gun cocks]
- Watch!

01:14:35.427 --> 01:14:35.949
- Val, get back!

01:14:36.210 --> 01:14:37.385
- Oh my God!

01:14:37.647 --> 01:14:42.739
[pensive music]
[flame hissing]

01:14:44.175 --> 01:14:45.045
- No!

01:14:45.263 --> 01:14:46.351
[dramatic music]

01:14:46.569 --> 01:14:48.484
[explosion booming]

01:14:48.745 --> 01:14:51.835
[Ben groans]
[somber music]

01:14:52.096 --> 01:14:55.752
[flames whooshing]
[glass shatters]

01:14:58.189 --> 01:15:00.757
[music continues]

01:15:07.198 --> 01:15:09.766
[music continues]

01:15:12.595 --> 01:15:15.380
[Mary groaning]

01:15:17.251 --> 01:15:19.863
[music continues]

01:15:25.042 --> 01:15:26.870
[shot firing]

01:15:28.219 --> 01:15:30.787
[music continues]

01:15:35.574 --> 01:15:37.228
- [Robert] Put 'em in the wagon!

01:15:39.839 --> 01:15:44.235
[Bella coughing]
[music continues]

01:15:44.452 --> 01:15:45.192
- Give me your hands.

01:15:48.587 --> 01:15:50.023
You got nine lives, kid.

01:15:50.284 --> 01:15:51.155
Move.

01:15:53.374 --> 01:15:54.114
- Hey!

01:15:55.463 --> 01:15:57.161
You see anyone else lyin'
around here who's wanted,

01:15:57.378 --> 01:15:58.379
point 'em out.

01:15:58.597 --> 01:16:00.338
When she does, put 'em in a bag,

01:16:00.556 --> 01:16:01.861
throw 'em on that wagon.

01:16:02.079 --> 01:16:04.342
We're collectin' on all of 'em.

01:16:04.560 --> 01:16:05.778
- [Valerie] Hey?

01:16:05.996 --> 01:16:08.302
[handcuffs clinking]

01:16:08.520 --> 01:16:10.783
[sullen music]

01:16:18.182 --> 01:16:20.750
[music continues]

01:16:25.755 --> 01:16:27.583
[gun clinking]

01:16:27.800 --> 01:16:29.933
[pensive music]

01:16:30.194 --> 01:16:31.717
- Get up.

01:16:32.457 --> 01:16:35.025
[Levi panting]

01:16:43.381 --> 01:16:45.818
[Levi coughs]

01:16:49.256 --> 01:16:51.781
[music continues]

01:16:54.827 --> 01:16:56.524
- Come on, get up.

01:16:56.742 --> 01:16:58.309
- Where the hell do
you think you're goin'?

01:16:58.526 --> 01:16:59.310
[horse whinnying]

01:16:59.571 --> 01:17:01.181
[Robert grunts]

01:17:01.442 --> 01:17:02.139
- You're hurting her!

01:17:02.356 --> 01:17:03.923
- Robert!

01:17:04.141 --> 01:17:06.056
Don't you touch them
again, you hear me?

01:17:09.146 --> 01:17:11.844
[horse whinnying]
[pensive music]

01:17:17.458 --> 01:17:18.242
- Gracie, come here.

01:17:21.462 --> 01:17:23.116
That's a good girl, come here.

01:17:23.377 --> 01:17:24.770
Come here.

01:17:25.031 --> 01:17:26.467
Yeah.

01:17:26.685 --> 01:17:28.469
Yeah, that's good.

01:17:28.687 --> 01:17:30.515
Hm, that's my girl.

01:17:30.733 --> 01:17:32.082
[horse whinnying]

01:17:34.519 --> 01:17:35.563
- I'm scared.
- Shh.

01:17:36.216 --> 01:17:37.653
We are either gonna
raise Gracie together,

01:17:44.398 --> 01:17:46.009
or not at all.

01:17:46.270 --> 01:17:48.838
[music continues]

01:17:52.537 --> 01:17:53.451
- Okay, fine.

01:17:54.408 --> 01:17:55.148
- Hm.

01:17:56.628 --> 01:17:58.325
[horse whinnying]

01:18:04.070 --> 01:18:05.942
[door clangs]
[Thomas grunts]

01:18:06.159 --> 01:18:08.684
[music continues]

01:18:16.779 --> 01:18:19.433
- Could turn ya in alive,

01:18:19.651 --> 01:18:21.131
but that would be more
trouble than it's worth.

01:18:24.090 --> 01:18:26.440
- Eh, just as good to me dead.

01:18:26.658 --> 01:18:27.267
- String 'em up!

01:18:27.485 --> 01:18:28.791
- Robert!

01:18:29.922 --> 01:18:30.793
Robert!

01:18:32.446 --> 01:18:33.709
- Where's Jericho?

01:18:33.926 --> 01:18:35.493
- Jericho's not in there.

01:18:35.754 --> 01:18:38.235
- Well, find his body!

01:18:38.452 --> 01:18:41.064
[music continues]

01:18:47.461 --> 01:18:49.725
[music continues]

01:18:51.117 --> 01:18:52.292
- You keep movin'.

01:18:52.510 --> 01:18:53.641
Get outta town.

01:18:53.859 --> 01:18:55.208
- What?
- You hear me?

01:18:55.426 --> 01:18:56.949
I'm proud of you.
- No, no.

01:18:57.167 --> 01:18:58.516
Dad!
No!

01:18:59.256 --> 01:19:03.869
[fire crackling]
[door creaking]

01:19:08.700 --> 01:19:11.616
[anticipatory music]

01:19:18.144 --> 01:19:21.017
[music continues]

01:19:28.198 --> 01:19:30.766
[music continues]

01:19:38.164 --> 01:19:41.689
[music continues]
[rope creaking]

01:19:43.082 --> 01:19:46.956
[cuff links clinking]
[horse whinnying]

01:19:48.609 --> 01:19:51.047
[music continues]

01:19:56.530 --> 01:19:59.446
[suspenseful music]

01:20:06.105 --> 01:20:09.021
[music continues]

01:20:15.419 --> 01:20:17.638
[horse whinnying]

01:20:24.776 --> 01:20:26.517
[music continues]

01:20:28.301 --> 01:20:29.737
- Sit right there.

01:20:33.829 --> 01:20:35.656
[horse whinnying]

01:20:37.702 --> 01:20:40.052
[key clinks]

01:20:43.447 --> 01:20:44.970
[music continues]
[horse whinnying]

01:20:45.666 --> 01:20:47.320
All right, Grace, let's go.

01:20:54.458 --> 01:20:55.981
Let's get in the stage coach.

01:20:58.244 --> 01:21:00.551
- Well, he's in there somewhere!

01:21:00.768 --> 01:21:02.640
Get some men, and burn 'em out.

01:21:06.949 --> 01:21:11.736
[Ben groaning]
[fire crackling]

01:21:22.834 --> 01:21:24.575
- Jesus fuckin' Christ!

01:21:29.623 --> 01:21:31.190
[Bella gasps]

01:21:31.408 --> 01:21:33.105
[horse whinnying]

01:21:34.628 --> 01:21:38.763
[ropes creaking]

01:21:38.981 --> 01:21:40.112
- First time I've
seen you tight lipped.

01:21:42.245 --> 01:21:44.334
- My, what a beautiful
morning it is.

01:21:44.551 --> 01:21:45.596
[rope creaking]

01:21:45.857 --> 01:21:46.597
- Yeah.

01:21:46.989 --> 01:21:49.556
[pensive music]

01:21:49.774 --> 01:21:50.949
Good a day as any I guess.

01:21:52.559 --> 01:21:53.560
- Get in the wagon!

01:21:53.778 --> 01:21:55.040
Hurry, now!

01:22:00.524 --> 01:22:02.961
Josh, what are we waitin' for?

01:22:03.179 --> 01:22:04.484
Hang 'em already!

01:22:04.745 --> 01:22:06.182
- You heard 'em, hang 'em!

01:22:09.446 --> 01:22:12.188
[music intensifies]

01:22:18.934 --> 01:22:21.675
[music continues]

01:22:21.893 --> 01:22:23.025
[panels thudding]

01:22:23.242 --> 01:22:27.986
[ax whooshing]
[upbeat music]

01:22:30.423 --> 01:22:34.079
[shot firing]
[hangman grunts]

01:22:34.340 --> 01:22:36.429
- [Posse Member]
He's on the roof!

01:22:36.690 --> 01:22:39.215
[shots firing]

01:22:40.172 --> 01:22:42.174
[yelling]

01:22:43.654 --> 01:22:44.220
- Thomas!

01:22:46.439 --> 01:22:50.008
[firing continues]
[horse whinnying]

01:23:05.850 --> 01:23:07.678
[wood creaking]

01:23:07.895 --> 01:23:09.897
[Lin groans]

01:23:10.159 --> 01:23:11.551
[James gasps]

01:23:11.812 --> 01:23:16.252
[firing continues]
[music continues]

01:23:21.170 --> 01:23:24.042
[music continues]

01:23:29.308 --> 01:23:31.136
[horse whinnying]

01:23:34.966 --> 01:23:35.923
- Gather up the rest of the men

01:23:36.185 --> 01:23:37.577
and make sure he's dead.

01:23:37.838 --> 01:23:41.233
[firing continues]
[horse whinnying]

01:23:47.326 --> 01:23:52.114
[bullets whizzing]
[music continues]

01:23:56.031 --> 01:23:58.381
[music continues]

01:23:58.642 --> 01:24:00.252
[Ben grunting]

01:24:07.564 --> 01:24:12.395
[firing continues]
[music continues]

01:24:21.708 --> 01:24:23.145
[cartridges clattering]

01:24:23.362 --> 01:24:26.670
[firing continues]
[music continues]

01:24:30.891 --> 01:24:33.111
[music continues]
[firing continues]

01:24:34.678 --> 01:24:36.288
[Jericho grunts]

01:24:36.506 --> 01:24:37.550
- Dad!

01:24:37.768 --> 01:24:38.334
- Doc?

01:24:39.378 --> 01:24:40.292
Doc?

01:24:40.510 --> 01:24:41.772
You okay, Doc?

01:24:42.033 --> 01:24:43.339
- My leg's broke.

01:24:47.256 --> 01:24:48.561
[head thuds]

01:24:49.562 --> 01:24:50.998
[guns cock]

01:24:51.216 --> 01:24:54.524
[all gasping]
[music continues]

01:24:57.483 --> 01:24:58.658
- [Posse Member] Get up <i>.</i>

01:25:01.096 --> 01:25:03.968
[music continues]

01:25:06.710 --> 01:25:07.580
- Dad!

01:25:10.017 --> 01:25:11.802
[gun cocks]
[music continues]

01:25:12.063 --> 01:25:13.717
- [Thalia] Drop 'em!

01:25:19.636 --> 01:25:20.245
Get up.

01:25:24.858 --> 01:25:25.816
Move it.

01:25:26.033 --> 01:25:27.905
[Doc groaning]

01:25:32.214 --> 01:25:37.001
[all gasping]
[music continues]

01:25:41.614 --> 01:25:43.964
[bullets clinking]

01:25:45.836 --> 01:25:47.359
[gun cocking]

01:25:55.802 --> 01:25:56.760
- How you's doin'?

01:25:56.977 --> 01:25:58.283
[punch thuds]

01:26:00.329 --> 01:26:01.591
Shit, son.

01:26:01.808 --> 01:26:03.854
That all you got [spits]?

01:26:04.898 --> 01:26:07.423
- When they done hangin', tie
him up next.

01:26:09.207 --> 01:26:12.079
[music continues]

01:26:14.386 --> 01:26:16.997
[wagon rattling]

01:26:18.564 --> 01:26:21.437
[music continues]

01:26:27.269 --> 01:26:29.967
[music continues]

01:26:37.017 --> 01:26:39.455
[music fades]

01:26:45.939 --> 01:26:47.332
[gun cocks]

01:26:52.076 --> 01:26:54.731
[rope creaking]

01:26:54.948 --> 01:26:56.428
[hooves clomping]

01:26:56.646 --> 01:26:59.431
[wagon rattling]

01:27:13.750 --> 01:27:16.231
[spurs clinking]

01:27:21.105 --> 01:27:23.281
- Hey, gonna need some help
with this body up here.

01:27:24.761 --> 01:27:27.677
[clinking continues]

01:27:31.071 --> 01:27:32.682
[shot firing]

01:27:33.683 --> 01:27:37.817
[dramatic music]
[firing continues]

01:27:39.689 --> 01:27:42.474
[singer vocalizing]

01:27:43.954 --> 01:27:45.042
[Thalia gasps]

01:27:47.479 --> 01:27:49.829
[Levi gasps]

01:27:51.788 --> 01:27:55.313
[music continues]
[vocalizing continues]

01:28:01.101 --> 01:28:01.798
[Bella grunts]

01:28:02.015 --> 01:28:05.018
[firing continues]

01:28:05.541 --> 01:28:10.328
[music continues]
[vocalizing continues]

01:28:12.896 --> 01:28:13.940
[punch thuds]

01:28:15.377 --> 01:28:18.162
[Bella groaning]

01:28:19.946 --> 01:28:23.385
[all groaning]
[rope creaking]

01:28:24.168 --> 01:28:26.170
[Ben straining]

01:28:26.388 --> 01:28:27.737
- Help me, Jesus!

01:28:27.954 --> 01:28:29.956
Help me, help me!

01:28:30.174 --> 01:28:30.957
Good God, y'all.

01:28:31.175 --> 01:28:32.132
Help me!

01:28:32.350 --> 01:28:33.960
Good God, y'all, help me!

01:28:34.178 --> 01:28:35.745
- Come on, Ben!

01:28:35.962 --> 01:28:39.183
- Help me, help me!
- Get your feet up!

01:28:39.401 --> 01:28:40.576
- Ben, push!

01:28:40.793 --> 01:28:42.882
- All right, all right!

01:28:43.143 --> 01:28:43.840
- Come on!

01:28:44.057 --> 01:28:45.102
- Help me, Jesus!

01:28:45.320 --> 01:28:47.278
[all grunting]

01:28:47.496 --> 01:28:48.975
Oh, good God!
- Oh, for fuck's sake.

01:28:49.193 --> 01:28:49.976
Jesus, help him out!

01:28:50.194 --> 01:28:51.587
- Good God, y'all!

01:28:51.848 --> 01:28:53.110
Help me!

01:28:53.328 --> 01:28:56.331
[dramatic music]

01:28:57.723 --> 01:28:58.594
- You all right?

01:28:58.855 --> 01:28:59.986
- Yeah.

01:29:00.204 --> 01:29:01.597
- I'll be back.

01:29:01.814 --> 01:29:03.425
Hang on.

01:29:03.686 --> 01:29:05.601
[hooves clomping]
[music continues]

01:29:12.259 --> 01:29:14.827
[music continues]

01:29:22.313 --> 01:29:24.924
[music continues]

01:29:27.057 --> 01:29:29.407
[Bella groaning]
[Thalia groaning]

01:29:29.625 --> 01:29:30.800
- Help me!

01:29:31.017 --> 01:29:32.149
[Bella groaning]

01:29:32.367 --> 01:29:33.585
[shot firing]

01:29:33.803 --> 01:29:34.934
[Ben groans]

01:29:35.195 --> 01:29:36.719
[panel thuds]
[rope creaking]

01:29:36.980 --> 01:29:39.417
[all gasping]

01:29:43.160 --> 01:29:45.815
[pensive music]

01:29:50.472 --> 01:29:51.864
[gun cocks]
[sullen music]

01:30:00.220 --> 01:30:02.788
[music continues]

01:30:05.965 --> 01:30:09.273
[Levi groans]
[music continues]

01:30:15.235 --> 01:30:17.803
[music continues]

01:30:19.239 --> 01:30:21.459
[gun cocks]

01:30:25.245 --> 01:30:27.813
[music continues]

01:30:35.255 --> 01:30:37.823
[music continues]

01:30:43.263 --> 01:30:44.961
[shot firing]

01:30:45.178 --> 01:30:48.007
[music intensifies]

01:30:56.015 --> 01:30:59.715
[wagon creaks]
[horse whinnying]

01:31:03.501 --> 01:31:05.329
[music continues]

01:31:05.547 --> 01:31:06.722
[Thalia thuds]

01:31:10.552 --> 01:31:11.466
- Bella!

01:31:12.249 --> 01:31:13.337
Help 'em.

01:31:18.211 --> 01:31:20.518
[Ben groaning]

01:31:20.736 --> 01:31:23.956
[rope creaking]
[music continues]

01:31:30.006 --> 01:31:33.531
[Levi groaning]
[music continues]

01:31:40.190 --> 01:31:44.977
[Ben gasps]
[music continues]

01:31:48.981 --> 01:31:52.637
[Levi gasping]
[Levi coughs]

01:31:54.334 --> 01:31:55.945
[Lin gasps]

01:31:56.162 --> 01:32:00.950
[Levi gasping]
[music continues]

01:32:05.171 --> 01:32:07.739
[music continues]

01:32:11.961 --> 01:32:13.484
- Come on, Kid.

01:32:13.702 --> 01:32:15.312
Come on, Kid, wake up.

01:32:17.227 --> 01:32:17.793
No.

01:32:19.621 --> 01:32:20.970
Don't, don't, don't.

01:32:23.233 --> 01:32:24.016
Kid, please.

01:32:26.192 --> 01:32:27.759
[James coughs]

01:32:30.240 --> 01:32:33.765
[Lin laughs]
[Bella laughs]

01:32:33.983 --> 01:32:34.549
Oh my God!

01:32:35.637 --> 01:32:38.204
[Levi laughs]

01:32:38.422 --> 01:32:40.990
[gentle music]

01:32:47.997 --> 01:32:51.261
[both grunting]
[pensive music]

01:32:55.221 --> 01:32:56.919
- Enough!

01:32:57.136 --> 01:32:57.789
- [Grace] You're hurting me!
- Shut up!

01:32:58.007 --> 01:32:58.964
- Let her go, Robert!

01:32:59.443 --> 01:33:01.271
- Move and I kill her!
- Robert!

01:33:01.532 --> 01:33:03.142
- Shut up!

01:33:03.403 --> 01:33:05.362
- You gonna kill
your own daughter?

01:33:05.623 --> 01:33:07.016
Is that what you're gonna do?

01:33:07.233 --> 01:33:09.105
[pensive music]

01:33:09.322 --> 01:33:09.975
- She didn't...

01:33:11.498 --> 01:33:12.456
She didn't tell you?

01:33:13.631 --> 01:33:15.067
You didn't tell 'em?

01:33:15.285 --> 01:33:15.851
Why?

01:33:16.982 --> 01:33:17.635
Why not?

01:33:17.853 --> 01:33:18.723
- Tell me what?

01:33:23.946 --> 01:33:25.208
- You're afraid he'd leave ya.

01:33:25.425 --> 01:33:26.426
Again!

01:33:28.690 --> 01:33:34.260
Thomas, Gracie is your
daughter, not mine!

01:33:35.044 --> 01:33:37.699
[pensive music]

01:33:40.049 --> 01:33:42.834
- Mama!
[Robert laughs]

01:33:44.140 --> 01:33:46.838
[music continues]

01:33:48.927 --> 01:33:50.320
- This has to end.

01:33:52.714 --> 01:33:53.889
I won't keep fightin' you.

01:34:02.114 --> 01:34:03.768
So I'll make ya a deal.

01:34:05.552 --> 01:34:07.250
Your life for hers.

01:34:07.467 --> 01:34:09.208
Put your gun to your head
and save your daughter.

01:34:10.732 --> 01:34:11.994
Do it and I swear,

01:34:12.255 --> 01:34:15.345
the moment you're dead,
I let 'em go forever.

01:34:15.562 --> 01:34:16.781
Do it, Thomas!

01:34:17.347 --> 01:34:19.175
Do it!
Your daughter is gonna die!

01:34:19.392 --> 01:34:21.220
Thomas, do it!

01:34:21.873 --> 01:34:22.744
Do it, Thomas!

01:34:22.961 --> 01:34:24.223
Do it!

01:34:24.484 --> 01:34:26.878
Your daughter is
gonna die, Thomas!

01:34:27.749 --> 01:34:29.315
- I'm sorry, Robert.

01:34:29.533 --> 01:34:31.013
- Your daughter is gonna
die because of you!

01:34:31.274 --> 01:34:32.014
[shot firing]

01:34:37.715 --> 01:34:40.065
[Grace sobs]

01:34:41.327 --> 01:34:42.894
- Come here, come here!

01:34:43.112 --> 01:34:46.376
[Valerie gasping]
[singer vocalizing]

01:34:52.643 --> 01:34:54.123
[horse whinnying]

01:34:54.863 --> 01:34:57.909
[soft music]
[vocalizing continues]

01:35:03.219 --> 01:35:06.831
[vocalizing continues]
[music continues]

01:35:09.138 --> 01:35:10.966
[horse whinnying]

01:35:13.185 --> 01:35:16.101
[vocalizing continues]
[music continues]

01:35:16.928 --> 01:35:19.670
[music fades]

01:35:19.888 --> 01:35:21.498
[hand thuds]
[light music]

01:35:26.851 --> 01:35:28.548
- Where'd everybody go?

01:35:31.160 --> 01:35:32.857
[Hoodoo groans]

01:35:37.514 --> 01:35:38.994
[Doc groans]

01:35:39.211 --> 01:35:40.430
- You all right?

01:35:41.474 --> 01:35:42.345
- Yep.

01:35:44.173 --> 01:35:46.653
We got one hell of
a mess to clean up.

01:35:46.915 --> 01:35:47.829
- Yeah.

01:35:48.046 --> 01:35:49.439
Been worse.

01:35:49.656 --> 01:35:53.312
[all laughing]

01:35:53.573 --> 01:35:54.836
- Course I shouldn't
drink too much

01:35:55.053 --> 01:35:56.620
if I aim to get into heaven,

01:35:56.838 --> 01:35:59.362
but it's goin' around
I'll take a sniff.

01:35:59.579 --> 01:36:01.103
[Levi coughs]

01:36:01.364 --> 01:36:03.540
- [groans] That's my
first time bein' hanged.

01:36:07.587 --> 01:36:09.894
[Hoodoo groans]

01:36:11.853 --> 01:36:12.810
- You save some of that for me.

01:36:13.028 --> 01:36:13.811
- Hey, here.

01:36:15.508 --> 01:36:17.075
- Hey, Ben, toss me that.

01:36:17.293 --> 01:36:18.033
- Thank you.

01:36:18.250 --> 01:36:19.861
Hey, pass it down.

01:36:20.078 --> 01:36:23.038
[upbeat music]

01:36:26.693 --> 01:36:27.912
- Oh, boy.

01:36:32.656 --> 01:36:37.704
[rock song playing]

01:37:14.132 --> 01:37:18.963
[rock song continues]

01:38:16.803 --> 01:38:20.807
[rock song continues]

01:38:46.442 --> 01:38:48.618
- All right, fellas, one
more hand, one more hand.

01:38:48.835 --> 01:38:52.143
Anybody needs to borrow some
money, no problem [laughs].

01:38:52.404 --> 01:38:54.189
And I got somethin' for
you like I promised.

01:38:54.406 --> 01:38:56.321
- Mind if we join?
- The more the merrier.

01:38:56.539 --> 01:38:59.237
I don't discriminate against
anybody [laughs].

01:38:59.455 --> 01:39:01.631
Prepare to lose
your money [laughs].

01:39:01.848 --> 01:39:03.676
I guess you all
wanna hear the story

01:39:03.894 --> 01:39:05.374
how I collected the biggest
reward ever [laughs].

01:39:07.463 --> 01:39:09.073
- You got your money.
- All right, good.

01:39:09.334 --> 01:39:10.640
All right, then.

01:39:11.336 --> 01:39:13.077
All right, sweetheart,
let's see what we got here.

01:39:13.556 --> 01:39:15.993
[laughs] We still
gettin' married, right?

01:39:16.211 --> 01:39:19.388
[laughs] Oh, look at that, dear!

01:39:19.605 --> 01:39:21.216
Woo!
All right.

01:39:21.477 --> 01:39:22.304
- Bring it here.
- Right there.

01:39:22.565 --> 01:39:23.479
Here we are.

01:39:23.696 --> 01:39:24.567
All right, fellas.

01:39:27.178 --> 01:39:28.049
Fellas?

01:39:29.746 --> 01:39:30.616
Kid?

01:39:32.140 --> 01:39:33.706
Doc?

01:39:33.924 --> 01:39:35.491
Whoa, no wait.

01:39:35.708 --> 01:39:36.187
Now hold, hold on, fellas!
[gun cocking]

01:39:36.405 --> 01:39:37.493
Where have you been?

01:39:37.710 --> 01:39:38.711
Hey, look what I've got for ya.

01:39:38.929 --> 01:39:39.712
Look what I got right here?

01:39:39.930 --> 01:39:41.192
I got you some gold.

01:39:41.410 --> 01:39:43.107
I saved this for ya.

01:39:43.325 --> 01:39:44.108
I was waitin' for ya. This whole
time I was wondering'

01:39:44.369 --> 01:39:45.892
where you were at, you two.

01:39:46.110 --> 01:39:47.633
Fellas, so good to see ya.

01:39:47.851 --> 01:39:48.678
Let's get these...

01:39:48.895 --> 01:39:49.896
bring up your glasses.

01:39:50.114 --> 01:39:51.507
Let's toast to Doc and Kid.

01:39:51.724 --> 01:39:53.335
Woo!
[guns cocking]

01:39:53.683 --> 01:39:54.510
[shots firing]
[blood splattering]

01:39:55.250 --> 01:39:59.123
[upbeat music]

01:40:02.605 --> 01:40:07.131
["The Gunslingers of
Redemption" playing]

01:41:08.279 --> 01:41:13.067
[song continues]

01:42:17.435 --> 01:42:20.612
[song fades]

01:42:49.032 --> 01:42:51.382
["Oh Lord" playing]

01:43:16.015 --> 01:43:19.280
[song continues]

01:43:48.613 --> 01:43:50.441
[music fades]
